---
title: Wandin Players
schedule: Wednesday evenings
order: 5
---
The Wandin Players Drama Group was established in 2007 and has performed productions of comedies each year. They rehearse in the church on Wednesday Evenings. New members are always welcome. Our next performances are on Friday 16 October at 7pm and Saturday 17th at 2pm. The plays are ***He Said and She Said*** and ***Mischief in the Magnolias***. Cost: $10.
